 "caveats": [
  "ci: 2024 values used throughout (OWID/Ember CSV also has partial 2025 values for many countries; not used for consistency). Ukraine uses 2022 (latest available).",
  "ci: Taiwan is covered by Ember/OWID directly (2024 = 635.2).",
  "ws: Aqueduct baseline covers hydrology 1979-2019; ranking file published 2023 (Y2023M07D05). Iceland scores 0 (genuinely low, not missing).",
  "ws: Aqueduct score is a banded score (0-1 Low <10%, 1-2 Low-Medium, 2-3 Medium-High, 3-4 High, 4-5 Extremely High >80% withdrawals/supply); dividing by 5 gives a 0-1 index, not a withdrawal ratio.",
  "aq: World Bank 2023 is the latest year in the API (last updated 2026-07-13); values are GBD 2023 modelled population-weighted exposure and differ from IQAir monitor averages.",
  "aq: Taiwan not in World Bank data; ministry station average used instead (different methodology)."
 ]
}